  "proposal": {
    "default": "Crate-private OwnedHashMap retaining inner std HashMap Clone and copied history; immutable Deref only; explicitly tracked mutation surface.",
    "exception": "Keep debug/fixture-public BattleCore.units concrete HashMap with owner-local sidecar if source API must remain; guarantee applies only to closed application-owned provenance, not arbitrary external raw mutations.",
    "mutation": "Credit insertion attempts and vacant Entry returns before native mutation; retain history across clear/remove; no raw mutable escape.",
    "serde": "Delegate Serialize to inner; delegate Deserialize to pinned fresh std HashMap Deserialize then initialize credit from tombstone-free fresh capacity; never accept arbitrary raw map capacity as history.",
    "semantics": "Equality/Debug/Serialize omit history; Clone preserves raw allocation/hasher/order by native Clone, without reinsertion.",
    "helper_impact": "Change private &mut HashMap helper parameters, notably result_stats::close_deployment, instead of exposing DerefMut."
  },
  "remaining_boundaries": [
    "Arbitrary external pub BattleCore.units mutation cannot be intercepted without API change; private application-owned provenance is required for the sidecar exception.",
    "HashSet and other transitive owners need separate coverage in whole visitor; this is a bounded map design, not an exhaustive heap proof.",
    "Custom reserve/extend/FromIterator/raw imports need construction/reservation accounting before adding those wrapper APIs.",
    "Root INPUTS035 tests were reported context, not rerun or independently verified."
